WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A qualified adult handler gives clear commands and maintains control
using appropriate professional equipment.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A trained adult decoy wears complete padded protective bite equipment.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The dog engages the protected equipment, maintains a controlled grip,
releases when commanded, and returns under control to the handler.
